1
00:00:00,086 --> 00:00:02,586
(Sheldon:)for a long period of time
might attract the attention

2
00:00:02,588 --> 00:00:05,358
(Sheldon:)of the hotel detective?

3
00:00:05,358 --> 00:00:07,088
(Leonard:)If we do,

4
00:00:07,093 --> 00:00:10,593
(Leonard:)we'll just tell him
to "hit the bricks, see?"

5
00:00:11,896 --> 00:00:14,966
(Sheldon:)Seems a little confrontational,
but all right.

6
00:00:16,267 --> 00:00:18,937
(Penny:)You know,
we won't be very far

7
00:00:18,938 --> 00:00:20,268
(Sheldon:)from Skywalker Ranch.

8
00:00:20,272 --> 00:00:22,272
(Leonard:)Oh, that's true.

9
00:00:22,274 --> 00:00:24,104
(Leonard:)It's not like
we can get in there.

10
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:26,210
(Sheldon:)Why not?

11
00:00:26,212 --> 00:00:28,212
I-I don't think George Lucas
put his headquarters

12
00:00:28,214 --> 00:00:31,184
(Leonard:)in the middle of nowhere because
he wanted people dropping in.

13
00:00:31,183 --> 00:00:35,523
(Sheldon:)Yoda's swamp was
in the middle of nowhere.

14
00:00:35,521 --> 00:00:37,691
(Sheldon:)Tatooine was in the middle
of nowhere.

15
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:39,760
(Sheldon:)Hoth was in the middle
of nowhere.

16
00:00:41,359 --> 00:00:42,859
(Sheldon:)That's code, Leonard.

17
00:00:42,862 --> 00:00:44,932
(Sheldon:)He wants us
to drop in.

18
00:00:47,565 --> 00:00:48,895
(Leonard:)We do have time.

19
00:00:48,901 --> 00:00:51,701
(Leonard:)I mean, we could drive by
and just look at it.

20
00:00:51,704 --> 00:00:53,804
Yes! Oh...

21
00:00:53,806 --> 00:00:55,476
(Sheldon:)I'm so excited.

22
00:00:55,474 --> 00:00:57,904
(Sheldon:)And I just can't hide it.

23
00:00:57,910 --> 00:01:03,020
"I'm about to lose control,
and I think I like it."

